           INVOICE EXTRACTOR ADVANCED - INSTRUCTIONS
============================================================
Author:  omegazyph
Date:    2026-02-11
------------------------------------------------------------

This is the Enterprise Tier tool. It extracts invoice data 
and automatically syncs it to a live Google Sheet.

🚀 HOW TO USE:
1. Place your 'credentials.json' file (from Google Cloud 
   Console) into the root folder.
2. Ensure you have a Google Sheet named "Invoice_Data_Sync".
3. Share that Google Sheet with the client email address 
   found inside your credentials.json file.
4. Place PDFs in 'Invoices' and run 'run_advanced_tool.bat'.

🛠 REQUIREMENTS:
- Python 3.x
- Libraries: pdfplumber, pandas, gspread, google-auth
- (Run 'pip install -r requirements.txt')

⚠️ SECURITY NOTE:
Never share your 'credentials.json' with anyone other than 
the intended user. It contains your API access keys.
============================================================
